{"t":"ANET","made":"2026-11-18 01:51","name":"Arista Networks, Inc.","ko":"아리스타","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","employees":5115,"hq":"Santa Clara, CA, United States","website":"https://www.arista.com","summary_en":"Arista Networks, Inc. engages in the development, marketing, and sale of data-driven, client to cloud networking solutions for AI, data center, campus, and routing environments in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia-Pacific. Its cloud networking solutions consist of Extensible Operating System (EOS), a publish-subscribe state-sharing networking operating system offered in combination with a set of network applications. The company offers data center, cloud and AI networking, cognitive adjacencies, and cognitive network software and services. It also provides post contract customer support services, such as technical support, hardware repair and replacement parts beyond standard warranty, bug fixes, patches, and upgrade services. The company serves a range of industries comprising internet companies, cloud service providers, financial services organizations, government agencies, media and entertainment, healthcare, oil and gas, education, manufacturing, industrial, and others. It markets and sells its products through distributors, system integrators, value-added resellers, and original equipment manufacturer partners, as well as through its direct sales force. Arista Networks, Inc. was formerly known as Arastra, Inc. and changed its name to Arista Networks, Inc. in October 2008. The company was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Arista Networks, Inc.는 미주, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 및 아시아 태평양 지역의 AI, 데이터 센터, 캠퍼스 및 라우팅 환경을 위한 데이터 기반, 클라이언트-클라우드 네트워킹 솔루션의 개발, 마케팅 및 판매에 참여하고 있습니다. 클라우드 네트워킹 솔루션은 일련의 네트워크 애플리케이션과 함께 제공되는 게시-구독 상태 공유 네트워킹 운영 체제인 EOS(확장 가능 운영 체제)로 구성됩니다. 이 회사는 데이터 센터, 클라우드 및 AI 네트워킹, 인지 인접성, 인지 네트워크 소프트웨어 및 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 기술 지원, 하드웨어 수리, 표준 보증 이상의 부품 교체, 버그 수정, 패치, 업그레이드 서비스 등 계약 후 고객 지원 서비스도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 인터넷 회사, 클라우드 서비스 제공업체, 금융 서비스 조직, 정부 기관, 미디어 및 엔터테인먼트, 의료, 석유 및 가스, 교육, 제조, 산업 등으로 구성된 다양한 산업 분야에 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 유통업체, 시스템 통합업체, 부가 가치 리셀러, OEM 파트너는 물론 직접 영업 인력을 통해 제품을 마케팅하고 판매합니다. Arista Networks, Inc.는 이전에 Arastra, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2008년 10월에 Arista Networks, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 2004년에 법인화되었으며 캘리포니아주 산타클라라에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":183.57,"mcap":231922778112.0,"pe":51.855934,"fpe":30.407488,"peg":1.432,"ps":19.505535,"pb":14.101245,"ev_ebitda":41.839,"div":0.0,"beta":1.637,"hi52":217.41,"lo52":114.52},"fin":{"rev":11890100224.0,"rev_g":0.585,"eps_g":0.821,"gross":0.62881,"op":0.43827,"net":0.39966,"roe":0.33519,"fcf":3001337600.0,"cash":14359000064.0,"debt":0.0,"de":null,"eps":3.54,"feps":6.037},"own":{"short":0.0115,"inst":0.73049,"insider":0.17226},"analyst":{"n":29,"mean":249.64662,"median":245.0,"high":305.0,"low":201.73,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.3,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":9,"buy":21,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":7,"buy":24,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":7,"buy":24,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":8,"buy":23,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":291.0,"priorPriceTarget":259.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":270.0,"priorPriceTarget":250.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":261.0,"priorPriceTarget":240.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPri